<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate soars to 29.1250 pc.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate soars to 29.1250 pc.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose by 182.5 basis points to 29.1250 percent on Tuesday, from 27.30 percent on Monday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised daily.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289558</p>
</text>
